#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:290
msgid ""
"**CURLRequest:** Added ``dns_cache_timeout`` option to change default DNS"
" cache timeout."
msgstr ""
"**CURLRequest:** 기본 DNS 캐시 시간 초과를 변경하는 ``dns_cache_timeout`` 옵션이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:291
msgid ""
"**CURLRequest:** Added ``fresh_connect`` options to enable/disable "
"request fresh connection."
msgstr ""
"**CURLRequest:** 요청 새로운 연결을 활성화/비활성화하는 ``fresh_connect`` 옵션이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:292
msgid "**DataConverter:** Added ``EnumCast`` caster for database and entity."
msgstr "**DataConverter:** 데이터베이스와 엔티티를 위한 ``EnumCast`` 캐스터가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:293
msgid ""
"**Email:** Added support for choosing the SMTP authorization method. You "
"can change it via ``Config\\Email::$SMTPAuthMethod`` option."
msgstr ""
"**Email:** SMTP 인증 방법을 선택하는 지원이 추가되었습니다. "
"``Config\\Email::$SMTPAuthMethod`` 옵션으로 변경할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:294
msgid ""
"**Encryption:** Added ``Config\\Encryption::$previousKeys`` configuration"
" option to support encryption key rotation. When decryption with the "
"current key fails, the system automatically falls back to previous keys, "
"allowing you to rotate encryption keys without losing access to old "
"encrypted data."
msgstr ""
"**Encryption:** 암호화 키 교체를 지원하는 ``Config\\Encryption::$previousKeys`` 설정 옵션이 추가되었습니다. "
"현재 키로 복호화에 실패하면 시스템이 자동으로 이전 키로 폴백하여, "
"이전에 암호화된 데이터에 대한 접근을 잃지 않고 암호화 키를 교체할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:295
msgid ""
"**Image:** The ``ImageMagickHandler`` has been rewritten to rely solely "
"on the PHP ``imagick`` extension."
msgstr ""
"**Image:** ``ImageMagickHandler``\\ 가 PHP ``imagick`` 확장에만 의존하도록 재작성되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:296
msgid ""
"**Image:** Added ``ImageMagickHandler::clearMetadata()`` method to remove"
" image metadata for privacy protection."
msgstr ""
"**Image:** 개인 정보 보호를 위해 이미지 메타데이터를 제거하는 "
"``ImageMagickHandler::clearMetadata()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:297
msgid ""
"**ResponseTrait:** Added ``paginate``` method to simplify paginated API "
"responses. See :ref:`ResponseTrait::paginate() "
"<api_response_trait_paginate>` for details."
msgstr ""
"**ResponseTrait:** 페이지네이션된 API 응답을 단순화하는 ``paginate`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`ResponseTrait::paginate() <api_response_trait_paginate>`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:298
msgid "**Session:** Added ``persistent`` config item to ``RedisHandler``."
msgstr "**Session:** ``RedisHandler``\\ 에 ``persistent`` 설정 항목이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:299
msgid ""
"**Session:** Added connection persistence for Redis and Memcached session"
" handlers via ``PersistsConnection`` trait, improving performance in "
"worker mode by reusing connections across requests."
msgstr ""
"**Session:** ``PersistsConnection`` 트레이트를 통해 Redis 및 Memcached 세션 핸들러에 "
"연결 지속성이 추가되어 요청 간 연결을 재사용함으로써 워커 모드에서 성능이 향상됩니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:300
msgid ""
"**Time:** added methods ``Time::addCalendarMonths()`` and "
"``Time::subCalendarMonths()``"
msgstr ""
"**Time:** ``Time::addCalendarMonths()``\\ 와 ``Time::subCalendarMonths()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:301
msgid ""
"**Time:** Added ``Time::isPast()`` and ``Time::isFuture()`` convenience "
"methods. See :ref:`isPast <time-comparing-two-times-isPast>` and "
":ref:`isFuture <time-comparing-two-times-isFuture>` for details."
msgstr ""
"**Time:** 편의 메서드 ``Time::isPast()``\\ 와 ``Time::isFuture()``\\ 가 추가되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`isPast <time-comparing-two-times-isPast>`\\ 와 "
":ref:`isFuture <time-comparing-two-times-isFuture>`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:302
msgid ""
"**Toolbar:** Fixed an issue where the Debug Toolbar was incorrectly "
"injected into responses generated by third-party libraries (e.g., Dompdf)"
" that use native PHP headers instead of the framework's Response object."
msgstr ""
"**Toolbar:** 프레임워크의 Response 객체 대신 네이티브 PHP 헤더를 사용하는 "
"서드파티 라이브러리(예: Dompdf)에서 생성된 응답에 디버그 툴바가 잘못 주입되는 문제가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:303
msgid ""
"**UserAgents:** Expanded the list of recognized ``robots`` with new "
"search engine and service crawlers."
msgstr ""
"**UserAgents:** 새로운 검색 엔진 및 서비스 크롤러로 인식되는 ``robots`` 목록이 확장되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:304
msgid ""
"**View:** Added the ability to override namespaced views (e.g., from "
"modules/packages) by placing a matching file structure within the "
"**app/Views/overrides** directory. See :ref:`Overriding Namespaced Views "
"<views-overriding-namespaced-views>` for details."
msgstr ""
"**View:** **app/Views/overrides** 디렉토리 내에 일치하는 파일 구조를 배치하여 "
"네임스페이스가 지정된 뷰(예: 모듈/패키지)를 재정의하는 기능이 추가되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`네임스페이스 뷰 재정의 <views-overriding-namespaced-views>`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:307
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "커맨드"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:309
msgid ""
"Added ``php spark worker:install`` command to generate FrankenPHP worker "
"mode files (Caddyfile and worker entry point)."
msgstr ""
"FrankenPHP 워커 모드 파일(Caddyfile 및 워커 진입점)을 생성하는 "
"``php spark worker:install`` 커맨드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:310
msgid "Added ``php spark worker:uninstall`` command to remove worker mode files."
msgstr "워커 모드 파일을 제거하는 ``php spark worker:uninstall`` 커맨드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:313
msgid "Database"
msgstr "데이터베이스"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:315
msgid ""
"**BaseConnection:** Added ``ping()`` method to check if the database "
"connection is still alive. OCI8 uses ``SELECT 1 FROM DUAL``, other "
"drivers use ``SELECT 1``."
msgstr ""
"**BaseConnection:** 데이터베이스 연결이 아직 활성 상태인지 확인하는 ``ping()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다. "
"OCI8은 ``SELECT 1 FROM DUAL``\\ 을, 다른 드라이버는 ``SELECT 1``\\ 을 사용합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:316
msgid ""
"**BaseConnection:** The ``reconnect()`` method now uses ``ping()`` to "
"check if the connection is alive before reconnecting. Previously, some "
"drivers would always close and reconnect unconditionally, and OCI8's "
"``reconnect()`` did nothing."
msgstr ""
"**BaseConnection:** ``reconnect()`` 메서드가 이제 재연결 전에 ``ping()``\\ 을 사용하여 "
"연결이 활성 상태인지 확인합니다. 이전에는 일부 드라이버가 항상 무조건 닫고 재연결했으며, "
"OCI8의 ``reconnect()``\\ 는 아무 동작도 하지 않았습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:317
msgid ""
"**Exception Logging:** All DB drivers now log database exceptions "
"uniformly. Previously, each driver had its own log format."
msgstr ""
"**Exception Logging:** 모든 DB 드라이버가 이제 데이터베이스 예외를 균일하게 로깅합니다. "
"이전에는 각 드라이버마다 자체 로그 형식이 있었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:320
msgid "Migrations"
msgstr "마이그레이션"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:322
msgid ""
"**MigrationRunner:** Added distributed locking support to prevent "
"concurrent migrations in multi-process environments. Enable with "
"``Config\\Migrations::$lock = true``."
msgstr ""
"**MigrationRunner:** 다중 프로세스 환경에서 동시 마이그레이션을 방지하기 위한 "
"분산 잠금 지원이 추가되었습니다. ``Config\\Migrations::$lock = true``\\ 로 활성화합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:325
msgid "HTTP"
msgstr "HTTP"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:328
msgid "Content Security Policy"
msgstr "콘텐츠 보안 정책"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:330
msgid ""
"The ``script-src`` and ``style-src`` directives can now use SHA-256, "
"SHA-384, and SHA-512 digests as their source expressions."
msgstr ""
"``script-src``\\ 와 ``style-src`` 지시문이 이제 소스 표현식으로 "
"SHA-256, SHA-384, SHA-512 다이제스트를 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:331
msgid "Added support for the new CSP Level 3 keywords:"
msgstr "새로운 CSP Level 3 키워드 지원이 추가되었습니다:"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:332
msgid "``'strict-dynamic'``"
msgstr "``'strict-dynamic'``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:333
msgid "``'unsafe-hashes'``"
msgstr "``'unsafe-hashes'``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:334
msgid "``'report-sample'``"
msgstr "``'report-sample'``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:335
msgid "``'unsafe-allow-redirects'``"
msgstr "``'unsafe-allow-redirects'``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:336
msgid "``'wasm-unsafe-eval'``"
msgstr "``'wasm-unsafe-eval'``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:337
msgid "``'trusted-types-eval'``"
msgstr "``'trusted-types-eval'``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:338
msgid "``'report-sha256'``"
msgstr "``'report-sha256'``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:339
msgid "``'report-sha384'``"
msgstr "``'report-sha384'``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:340
msgid "``'report-sha512'``"
msgstr "``'report-sha512'``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:341
msgid "Added support for the following CSP Level 3 directives:"
msgstr "다음 CSP Level 3 지시문 지원이 추가되었습니다:"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:342
msgid "``report-to``"
msgstr "``report-to``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:343
msgid "``script-src-elem``"
msgstr "``script-src-elem``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:344
msgid "``script-src-attr``"
msgstr "``script-src-attr``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:345
msgid "``style-src-elem``"
msgstr "``style-src-elem``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:346
msgid "``style-src-attr``"
msgstr "``style-src-attr``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:347
msgid "``worker-src``"
msgstr "``worker-src``"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:349
msgid ""
"Update your CSP configuration in **app/Config/ContentSecurityPolicy.php**"
" to include these new directives."
msgstr ""
"**app/Config/ContentSecurityPolicy.php**\\ 의 CSP 설정을 업데이트하여 이 새로운 지시문을 포함하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:352
msgid "Others"
msgstr "기타"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:354
msgid ""
"**Controller Attributes:** Added support for PHP Attributes to define "
"filters and other metadata on controller classes and methods. See "
":ref:`Controller Attributes <incoming/controller_attributes>` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"**Controller Attributes:** 컨트롤러 클래스와 메서드에 필터 및 기타 메타데이터를 정의하기 위한 "
"PHP 속성(Attributes) 지원이 추가되었습니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :ref:`컨트롤러 속성 <incoming/controller_attributes>`\\ 를 참조하세요."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:358
msgid "Message Changes"
msgstr "메시지 변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:360
msgid ""
"Added ``Email.invalidSMTPAuthMethod``, ``Email.failureSMTPAuthMethod``, "
"``CLI.signals.noPcntlExtension``, ``CLI.signals.noPosixExtension`` and "
"``CLI.signals.failedSignal``."
msgstr ""
"``Email.invalidSMTPAuthMethod``, ``Email.failureSMTPAuthMethod``, "
"``CLI.signals.noPcntlExtension``, ``CLI.signals.noPosixExtension``, "
"``CLI.signals.failedSignal``\\ 이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:361
msgid "Deprecated ``Email.failedSMTPLogin`` and ``Image.libPathInvalid``."
msgstr "``Email.failedSMTPLogin``\\ 와 ``Image.libPathInvalid``\\ 가 사용 중단되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:362
msgid "Changed ``Session.missingDatabaseTable``."
msgstr "``Session.missingDatabaseTable``\\ 이 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:366
msgid "Changes"
msgstr "변경사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:368
msgid ""
"**Boot:** Added ``Boot::bootWorker()`` method for one-time worker "
"initialization."
msgstr ""
"**Boot:** 일회성 워커 초기화를 위한 ``Boot::bootWorker()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:369
msgid ""
"**CodeIgniter:** Added ``CodeIgniter::resetForWorkerMode()`` method to "
"reset request-specific state between worker requests."
msgstr ""
"**CodeIgniter:** 워커 요청 간 요청별 상태를 초기화하는 "
"``CodeIgniter::resetForWorkerMode()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:370
msgid ""
"**Config:** Added ``app/Config/WorkerMode.php`` for worker mode "
"configuration (persistent services, garbage collection)."
msgstr ""
"**Config:** 워커 모드 설정(영구 서비스, 가비지 컬렉션)을 위한 "
"``app/Config/WorkerMode.php``\\ 가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:371
msgid ""
"**Cookie:** The ``CookieInterface::EXPIRES_FORMAT`` has been changed to "
"``D, d M Y H:i:s T`` to follow the recommended format in RFC 7231."
msgstr ""
"**Cookie:** ``CookieInterface::EXPIRES_FORMAT``\\ 이 RFC 7231의 권장 형식을 따르기 위해 "
"``D, d M Y H:i:s T``\\ 로 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:372
msgid ""
"**DatabaseConfig:** Added ``Config::reconnectForWorkerMode()`` and "
"``Config::cleanupForWorkerMode()`` methods for database connection "
"management in worker mode."
msgstr ""
"**DatabaseConfig:** 워커 모드에서 데이터베이스 연결 관리를 위한 "
"``Config::reconnectForWorkerMode()``\\ 와 ``Config::cleanupForWorkerMode()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:373
msgid "**Events:** Added ``Events::cleanupForWorkerMode()`` method."
msgstr "**Events:** ``Events::cleanupForWorkerMode()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:374
msgid ""
"**Format:** Added support for configuring ``json_encode()`` maximum depth"
" via ``Config\\Format::$jsonEncodeDepth``."
msgstr ""
"**Format:** ``Config\\Format::$jsonEncodeDepth``\\ 를 통해 ``json_encode()`` 최대 깊이를 "
"설정하는 지원이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:375
msgid ""
"**Paths:** Added support for changing the location of the ``.env`` file "
"via the ``Paths::$envDirectory`` property."
msgstr ""
"**Paths:** ``Paths::$envDirectory`` 속성을 통해 ``.env`` 파일의 위치를 변경하는 "
"지원이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:376
msgid ""
"**Services:** Added ``Services::resetForWorkerMode()`` and "
"``Services::reconnectCacheForWorkerMode()`` methods."
msgstr ""
"**Services:** ``Services::resetForWorkerMode()``\\ 와 "
"``Services::reconnectCacheForWorkerMode()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:377
msgid ""
"**Toolbar:** Added ``$disableOnHeaders`` property to "
"**app/Config/Toolbar.php**."
msgstr ""
"**Toolbar:** **app/Config/Toolbar.php**\\ 에 ``$disableOnHeaders`` 속성이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:378
msgid ""
"**Toolbar:** Added ``Toolbar::reset()`` method to reset debug toolbar "
"collectors."
msgstr ""
"**Toolbar:** 디버그 툴바 수집기를 초기화하는 ``Toolbar::reset()`` 메서드가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:382
msgid "Deprecations"
msgstr "사용 중단"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:384
msgid "**ContentSecurityPolicy:**"
msgstr "**ContentSecurityPolicy:**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:385
msgid ""
"The ``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\ContentSecurityPolicy::$nonces`` property has "
"been deprecated. It was never used."
msgstr ""
"``CodeIgniter\\HTTP\\ContentSecurityPolicy::$nonces`` 속성이 사용 중단되었습니다. "
"사용된 적이 없습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:386
msgid "**Encryption:**"
msgstr "**Encryption:**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:387
msgid ""
"The method "
"``CodeIgniter\\Encryption\\Handlers\\SodiumHandler::parseParams()`` has "
"been deprecated. Parameters are now handled directly in ``encrypt()`` and"
" ``decrypt()`` methods."
msgstr ""
"``CodeIgniter\\Encryption\\Handlers\\SodiumHandler::parseParams()`` 메서드가 사용 중단되었습니다. "
"매개변수는 이제 ``encrypt()``\\ 와 ``decrypt()`` 메서드에서 직접 처리됩니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:388
msgid "**Image:**"
msgstr "**Image:**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:389
msgid ""
"The config property ``Config\\Image::libraryPath`` has been deprecated. "
"No longer used."
msgstr ""
"``Config\\Image::libraryPath`` 설정 속성이 사용 중단되었습니다. 더 이상 사용되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:390
msgid ""
"The exception method "
"``CodeIgniter\\Images\\Exceptions\\ImageException::forInvalidImageLibraryPath``"
" has been deprecated. No longer used."
msgstr ""
"``CodeIgniter\\Images\\Exceptions\\ImageException::forInvalidImageLibraryPath`` 예외 메서드가 "
"사용 중단되었습니다. 더 이상 사용되지 않습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:394
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:396
msgid ""
"**Cookie:** The ``CookieInterface::SAMESITE_STRICT``, "
"``CookieInterface::SAMESITE_LAX``, and ``CookieInterface::SAMESITE_NONE``"
" constants are now written in ucfirst style to be consistent with usage "
"in the rest of the framework."
msgstr ""
"**Cookie:** ``CookieInterface::SAMESITE_STRICT``, ``CookieInterface::SAMESITE_LAX``, "
"``CookieInterface::SAMESITE_NONE`` 상수가 이제 프레임워크의 나머지 부분과 일관성을 위해 "
"ucfirst 스타일로 작성됩니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:397
msgid ""
"**Cache:** Changed ``WincacheHandler::increment()`` and "
"``WincacheHandler::decrement()`` to return ``bool`` instead of ``mixed``."
msgstr ""
"**Cache:** ``WincacheHandler::increment()``\\ 와 ``WincacheHandler::decrement()``\\ 이 "
"``mixed`` 대신 ``bool``\\ 을 반환하도록 변경되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:398
msgid ""
"**Entity:** Calling ``CodeIgniter\\Entity\\Entity::toArray()`` always "
"changed the value of ``$_cast`` to ``true``, instead of restoring the "
"initial value."
msgstr ""
"**Entity:** ``CodeIgniter\\Entity\\Entity::toArray()`` 호출 시 초기값을 복원하는 대신 "
"항상 ``$_cast`` 값이 ``true``\\ 로 변경되던 문제가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:399
msgid ""
"**Toolbar:** Fixed **Maximum call stack size exceeded** crash when AJAX-"
"like requests (HTMX, Turbo, Unpoly, etc.) were made on pages with Debug "
"Toolbar enabled."
msgstr ""
"**Toolbar:** 디버그 툴바가 활성화된 페이지에서 AJAX 유사 요청(HTMX, Turbo, Unpoly 등)을 "
"수행할 때 **최대 콜 스택 크기 초과** 충돌이 발생하는 문제가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.7.0.rst:401
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
